  <h2>Craft Draft: cold brew vs. cold-brewed</h2>
  <p>Our patent-pending process embeds flavor stability into our kegs for at least 120 days. That is 3-4 times the life of our competitor’s cold brew kegs. Every keg we produce is created using this process.</p>
  <p>We extract the best that each coffee or tea has to give, accentuate their unique nuance flavors and preserve them inside a keg using strict sanitation and preservation standards. The flavor profile of each of our products remains authentic, unique, and extraordinary. Best of all our nitro products are made with the best organic and natural ingredients available, pure water, organic coffee (or tea), and pure nitrogen gas. No artificial preservatives or stabilizers are used in our process.</p>
